l id="d9164" value="&lt;b&gt;Solid arrow = call.  Dashed arrow = return.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The only work that scales with the dataset is step 5, which is arithmetic on the scroll offset - it does not touch the rows. Steps 6 to 10 run once per VISIBLE cell (about 250 per frame), which is why the frame time is identical at 100,000 and 1,000,000 rows." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="1060" width="1120" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>